    "acceptanceCriteria": [
      {
        "id": "AC-1",
        "text": "After `app.route(Method.get().post().delete(), \"/users/:id\", h)`, `GET`, `POST` and `DELETE /users/1` through the harness all reach `h`, and `PUT /users/1` is answered `405`. [D-041; T01] Decision: `app.get(p, h)` and a builder `get(h)` record the same registration (method set `MethodSet.of(GET)`, pattern `p`, HTTP route kind), so the freeze reports such a pair as a duplicate. [SDS 2026-10-19.naruserve.naruserve-v1-wave-3-3 SDS-AC-11]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 1149
      },
      {
        "id": "AC-2",
        "text": "Inside `h`, `req.method()` returns `Method.GET`, `Method.POST` and `Method.DELETE` for those three requests respectively. [D-042; T01]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 1150
      },
      {
        "id": "AC-3",
        "text": "After `app.route(Method.PATCH, \"/p\", h)`, `PATCH /p` reaches `h` with `req.method()` = `Method.PATCH`. [D-041; D-042]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 1151
      },
      {
        "id": "AC-4",
        "text": "`HEAD /users/1` reaches `h` through automatic `HEAD` with `req.method()` = `Method.HEAD`. [D-042; wave decision: req.method() during automatic HEAD]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 1152
      }
    ],
